OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon fancier 'determined' to
OL,4,Arecover from fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pigeon fancier who lost 300 of his
OL,7,Fprized birds in a fire has said the
OL,8,Fsupport from the local community has
OL,9,Fmade him "determined" to recover.
OL,11,FDanny Rodgers, who rears the birds with
OL,12,Fhis father Ken Biggs, said he was
OL,13,Falerted to a fire at their pigeon loft
OL,14,Fin a Cleator Moor allotment on 17 July
OL,15,F- by which time "everything had already
OL,16,Fgone".
OL,18,FHowever, a fundraiser to reconstruct
OL,19,Fthe building and help the pair get back
OL,20,Fon their feet has raised #17,000 so
OL,21,Ffar.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
