OL,3,GNEWSAPigeon fancier 'determined' to
OL,4,Arecover from fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FRodgers said: "The support, generosity,
OL,7,Fand just basically encouragement to
OL,8,Fcarry on has given us the determination
OL,9,Fto get back - I want to thank everyone
OL,10,Ffor that."
